//! Phase B — every zero-argument accessor exported by the library.
//!
//! 374 nullary entry points (constant accessors, `*_primitive` names, the
//! `sodium_runtime_has_*` predicates, the secretstream tag values, the XOF
//! domain bytes...). Each is looked up in BOTH `.so`s via `dlsym` and the
//! returned value must be identical.
//!
//! ### Row coverage (generated by `.phaseA/rowmap_mine.py`)
//!
//! | test | table | rows |
//! |---|---|---|
//! | `size_t_accessors_match` | CONFIGS | G3-001, G3-032, G3-059, G3-082, G3-101, G3-121, G3-122 |
//! | `ull_accessors_match` | CONFIGS | G3-132 |
//! | `int_accessors_match` | CONFIGS | G3-120 |

